## 4. Layout Constraints
- Hierarchy Level 1: Primary SaaS health & F2F service queues (Top 35% viewport).
- Hierarchy Level 2: Real-time event streams with progressive disclosure (Middle 45% viewport, folded under drill-down accordions).
- Hierarchy Level 3: Secondary audit feeds (Bottom 20%, paginated).
```